only. All sessions are logged and audited.</aside></section><footer class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-center text-sm"><p><a href="RHUAdminLogin.php" class="font-semibold text-gray-500">RHU Admin</a> <span class="mx-2 text-gray-300">|</span><a href="BHWLogin.php" class="font-semibold text-gray-500">BHW Portal</a></p><p class="text-xs text-gray-400">Resident? <a href="ResidentLogin.php" class="font-semibold text-emerald-600">Go to Resident Portal</a></p><a href="LandingPage.php" class="text-gray-400">← Back to Home</a></footer></main></body></html>
